.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YbHy2PdiktUQ7kNvwHdlNbK&_nc_oc=Adk4j6yngSczaj32HwaubJF6CL2KbEU0Pyjphj7-dlCkCls6xG-0yK-XbwlRnNjnQPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz1Kc7FOlqJdJDGszIjIbbziB-I7gZNUGH3O3IUFJk6Lg&oe=69B6B098"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQCwQ5Iydh8Q7kNvwFmAnzi&_nc_oc=AdlVvMJXQWm6eE5w78zASDy9mWd-x0Hloud4hadgxzwnSiyz3vHT8sY1DvxDNRgQKf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxkVbQGJZmqUESCXK50cyqcIAM5Dk_Fjk7p3_eiUg0jkQ&oe=69B6ADC0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=evPBV7kp-9IQ7kNvwFv0ZAI&_nc_oc=Adn0wL0eZuPgfWzJFPT_J-hftyxL643ZhMxDKm2qIK8cjFHyozOGTk3hLoedUR7iiL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afws5PbPtEM7pZOkhy8GqZC5DvzF6iXcy5ahND8qBpHSpw&oe=69B6ADF3"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p